On Mar 15, 8:06=A0pm, glen herrmannsfeldt <g...@ugcs.caltech.edu> wrote:
> The LSI-11 that I have was given to me when someone stopped
> using it in a lab. =A0It came as a two box system, which the extension
> a non-DEC box, but with more slots. =A0When I moved, I didn't bring
